// Test that swift-reflection-dump handles binaries with chained fixups
// REQUIRES: swift-reflection-dump

// The tool should successfully process binaries with chained fixups (iOS 15+/macOS 12+)
// without crashing, even if the binary has no Swift metadata

// RUN: %swift-reflection-dump -arch arm64 %platform-sdk-overlay-dir/libswiftCore.dylib | %FileCheck %s --allow-empty

// CHECK-NOT: Error
// CHECK-NOT: abort
// CHECK-NOT: unhandled Error

// This basic test verifies that:
// 1. The tool doesn't crash on binaries with chained fixups
// 2. Error handling is correct for the fixupTable API
// 3. Both traditional binds and chained fixups are processed